      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LAYER 4: Wayland Clients & Trust Domains (M2–M5)\n• Trusted Shell UI: Mini-Globe, Polar Docks, Launcher, First-Boot, Settings\n• Wayland Clients: Terminal (M2), Wayland Browser & File Manager (M3) via DMA-BUF\n• Per-Domain Sandbox (M5, #13): namespaces, seccomp, cgroups, clipboard vault",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LAYER 4: Wayland Clients & Trust Domains (M2–M5)\n• Trusted Shell UI: Mini-Globe, Polar Docks, Launcher, First-Boot, Settings\n• Wayland Clients: Terminal (M2), Wayland Browser & File Manager (M3) via DMA-BUF\n• Per-Domain Sandbox (M5, #13): namespaces, seccomp, cgroups, clipboard vault"
    },
