      "updated": 1763480000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LAYER 3: Compositor & Session — spheradian/spheradian (Public Apache-2.0, ADR-003)\n• spheradian (Smithay + wgpu, safe Rust, unsafe forbidden, no X11/Xwayland)\n• Pure Core: input, state, commands, WindowSurfaceProvider (unit-testable without GPU)\n• Fallback Flat Wayland Session (M1, #5) when Vulkan/GL is unavailable",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LAYER 3: Compositor & Session — spheradian/spheradian (Public Apache-2.0, ADR-003)\n• spheradian (Smithay + wgpu, safe Rust, unsafe forbidden, no X11/Xwayland)\n• Pure Core: input, state, commands, WindowSurfaceProvider (unit-testable without GPU)\n• Fallback Flat Wayland Session (M1, #5) when Vulkan/GL is unavailable"
    },
