      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LAYER 2: Debian minbase Substrate — spheradian/spheradianos (Public Apache-2.0)\n• Core OS (M0): Debian trixie minbase, systemd, dbus, udev, seatd/logind (no Recommends)\n• Media & Net (M1–M3): Mesa Vulkan/GL, PipeWire/WirePlumber, NetworkManager vs iwd (#8, #10)\n• Packaging & Install (M4, #11, #12): Signed APT repo, spheradianos-base metapackage, Installer",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LAYER 2: Debian minbase Substrate — spheradian/spheradianos (Public Apache-2.0)\n• Core OS (M0): Debian trixie minbase, systemd, dbus, udev, seatd/logind (no Recommends)\n• Media & Net (M1–M3): Mesa Vulkan/GL, PipeWire/WirePlumber, NetworkManager vs iwd (#8, #10)\n• Packaging & Install (M4, #11, #12): Signed APT repo, spheradianos-base metapackage, Installer"
    },
