      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LAYER 1: Boot Chain & Early Experience (M0 / M2)\n• Bootloaders (ADR-002, #14): GRUB-EFI & ISOLINUX zero-prompt (timeout=0, Shift for fail-safe)\n• Kernel: linux-image-amd64 + simpledrm -> native KMS handover (quiet loglevel=3)\n• Plymouth spheradian (~18 KiB): arithmetic lattice, 20s watchdog, flicker-free hand-off B4 (#7)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LAYER 1: Boot Chain & Early Experience (M0 / M2)\n• Bootloaders (ADR-002, #14): GRUB-EFI & ISOLINUX zero-prompt (timeout=0, Shift for fail-safe)\n• Kernel: linux-image-amd64 + simpledrm -> native KMS handover (quiet loglevel=3)\n• Plymouth spheradian (~18 KiB): arithmetic lattice, 20s watchdog, flicker-free hand-off B4 (#7)"
    },
